  <title>
    <media type="image" width="40px" height="40px" its:translate="no" src="figures/orca-logo.svg" /> Learn mode
  </title>
  <p>
    Learn mode lets you explore Orca shortcuts without performing their commands. Press a key or
    key combination, and Orca presents the associated command description in speech and braille,
    if one is assigned.
  </p>
