            <key>Orca Modifier</key>
            <key>H</key>
          </keyseq>
        </p>
        <p>
          Enters learn mode. Press <key>F1</key> to leave learn mode and open Orca
          help. Press <key>F2</key> to leave learn mode and show Orca
          shortcuts. Press <key>Escape</key> to exit without opening
          another window.
